[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1103","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1418","title":"ICQ ICQ 99a Web服务器路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"ICQ 99a 的 Web 服务器组件（build 1701）在启用 \"Active Homepage\" 功能时存在文件存在性信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向目标服务器发送特定的文件路径请求，根据服务器返回 \"404 Forbidden\"（文件存在）与 \"404 Not Found\"（文件不存在）的不同响应状态码，判断服务器上敏感文件是否存在，从而为进一步攻击收集信息。该漏洞影响 ICQ 99a 版本，危害等级中危。厂商尚未发布官方修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1418"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:23Z","remediation":"立即禁用 ICQ 99a 的 \"Active Homepage\" 功能（在设置中取消勾选），或升级至 ICQ 2000b 及以上版本。如无法升级，在系统防火墙中阻止外部对 ICQ 内嵌 Web 服务器端口（默认 7326/TCP）的访问，仅允许本地回环地址连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/13508","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/246","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/48e2428aa9b9856f01006cca01971bc2ae076616/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1418.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1418","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1418.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1418.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/icq_vulns.nasl","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/icq_installed.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1418.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/246/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1103.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0570","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0570.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0807","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9121,\"outputTokens\":17,\"totalTokens\":10802}}","description":"Netscape Directory Server 在安装过程中会将包含敏感信息（如管理员口令、配置凭据等）的文件以不当权限保留在本地文件系统中，该文件可被本地普通用户直接读取。此漏洞影响在本地安装 Netscape Directory Server 的系统，攻击条件为攻击者需拥有目标主机的本地登录权限或本地文件读取权限。本地用户通过访问安装过程遗留的敏感文件即可获取凭据等关键信息，进而可能提升权限或进一步攻击目录服务，造成信息泄露与潜在的服务沦陷风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0807"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:05Z","remediation":"安装完成后立即删除安装过程中生成的临时文件（如 install.log、setup.ini），并将安装目录权限设置为 750（仅管理员可读写执行），防止本地用户访问敏感配置信息。建议升级至 Red Hat Directory Server 或 389 Directory Server 等仍在维护的替代产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0807","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1ce36d0de2f3ddd1d56c222c398df994c8c331b1/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0807.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0807","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0807.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f581b54f28a314b57ac171b83d3b2d21db7414a0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0807.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/11845a9fe6e6b4d82150d9fd8a4257b88a244a45/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wq96-x226-v8pj/GHSA-wq96-x226-v8pj.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0807.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88045/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000620.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7f943c92-5f2b-46a9-a805-848982ba4e64.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0570.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0481","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0481.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0764","title":"NetBSD ARP 协议实现安全缺陷（ARP 欺骗）","description":"NetBSD 操作系统的 ARP 协议实现存在安全缺陷，系统在接收到 ARP 数据包时未对静态 ARP 条目进行有效保护。攻击者只要处于同一局域网二层广播域中，即可通过构造并发送伪造的 ARP 数据包（ARP 欺骗/ARP 毒化），使内核用攻击者提供的 MAC 地址覆盖管理员预先手动配置的静态 ARP 映射。该漏洞影响运行 NetBSD 且配置了静态 ARP 条目的主机，攻击无需身份认证，仅需网络可达。利用成功后，攻击者可实施中间人攻击、流量劫持或拒绝服务，进而监听或篡改目标主机与其他设备之间的通信।","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0764"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:00Z","remediation":"升级 NetBSD 到 1.4 及以上版本或应用特定安全补丁：https://ftp.NetBSD.org/pub/NetBSD/misc/security/patches/19990208-netstat，该补丁修复了 ARP 协议相关的内核内存访问控制问题。此外，如无法立即更新，可以通过 `chmod 400 /usr/sbin/netstat` 禁止非根用户访问 netstat 命令以缓解该 ARP 条目覆盖漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T06:12:45Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6539","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e244b55bdff85b2483c0e6a7cecd12f8bee0df6e/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0764.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0764"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0481.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0480","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0480.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0763","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9111,\"outputTokens\":20,\"totalTokens\":10795}}","description":"CVE-1999-0763 是 NetBSD 操作系统在多宿主主机（即配备多个网络接口并连接不同网络的主机）上存在的 ARP 缓存处理缺陷。攻击者可向其中一个网络发送特制的 ARP 数据包，由于系统未能正确隔离不同网络接口上的 ARP 信息，该数据包会被错误地用于修改另一个相连网络的 ARP 缓存条目，从而实施 ARP 欺骗或中间人攻击。该漏洞影响运行 NetBSD 且配置为连接多个网络的多宿主主机，攻击条件为攻击者能够访问其中一个相连网络并向目标发送伪造的 ARP 报文，利用方式是通过跨网络的 ARP 缓存污染实现流量劫持或会话拦截。CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级为中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0763"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:00Z","remediation":"升级到 NetBSD 1.4 及以上版本，或从 ftp://ftp.NetBSD.ORG/pub/NetBSD/misc/security/patches/19990505-arp 获取并应用内核补丁。如无法升级，可在各网络接口上使用 arp -s 添加静态 ARP 条目并配合防火墙规则限制 ARP 流量来源，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6540","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e268305fd8644994d337819e469d1f89bafde833/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0763.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0763","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0763.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0ea6b1a1298433599abdd2a4c6b6ce9f09476665/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0763.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d9ad03f9df46533ce9229f9da6bbf66bd77a3f4f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3q2q-j727-g75q/GHSA-3q2q-j727-g75q.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0763.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000619.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/39b9df25423a93bff6d75a66d90cb36757da74c2/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0480.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0159","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0159.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0487","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer DHTML Edit ActiveX 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 中的 DHTML Edit ActiveX 控件存在任意文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，诱使用户在 IE 浏览器中访问，利用该 ActiveX 控件的跨帧访问特性读取目标系统上的任意文件内容。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4 和 5 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可实施攻击，危害用户隐私安全。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0487"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:30Z","remediation":"升级到 Internet Explorer 6 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 IE 5.5 SP2 及后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可通过注册表设置 Kill Bit 禁用 DHTML Edit ActiveX 控件（CLSID: {2D360201-FFF5-11D1-8D03-00A0C959BC0A}），在 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Internet Explorer\\ActiveX Compatibility 下创建对应 CLSID 项并将 Compatibility Flags 设为 0x400。建议迁移至现代浏览器（如 Edge/Chrome/Firefox）以彻底规避风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-011","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19094","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58a0ea900decdd7e971b95fcaa99234de5a5df5e/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0487.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0487","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0487.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dabf5b9888e8885cf125c5729901a7ad84d00092/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0487.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/18de81c56daca1c9e33223f0b95bdb8312a1ca75/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-79cg-j8cc-gwm8/GHSA-79cg-j8cc-gwm8.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0487.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/bibliotxt/bibliotxt/blob/07bb3ac8e74e6f78514faabae1ce10b662cf48a1/zines/trenchcoat-diaries/tcpaper2.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0159.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0159.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0007","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0194","title":"UNIX in.comsat 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"in.comsat（Unix 邮件通知服务）存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标主机的 comsat 服务（UDP 512 端口）发送特制的伪造消息数据包，触发服务生成大量告警通知并消耗系统资源，导致目标主机拒绝服务。受影响的系统包括各类 Unix 衍生系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等问题。厂商已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0194"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:53Z","remediation":"在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释或删除 comsat 行并重启 inetd 服务以禁用该服务；或在防火墙上封禁外部对 UDP 512 端口的访问。如需保留功能，请升级操作系统至厂商已发布修复补丁的最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0194"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0303","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0303.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0711","title":"Oracle 8.x Intelligent Agent oratclsh 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Oracle 8.x Unix版智能代理中的oratclsh解释器存在权限提升漏洞。该解释器设置了SUID位，导致本地攻击者可以root用户身份执行任意Tcl命令，从而完全控制目标系统。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用此漏洞，CVSS评分4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0711"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:53Z","remediation":"立即从 Oracle Metalink（http://www.oracle.com/support/elec_sup）下载并运行 setuid_patch.sh 脚本，该脚本会移除 oratclsh 可执行文件并清除所有非必要 Oracle 二进制文件的 setuid 权限位。如无法获取补丁，可手动执行 `chmod -s $ORACLE_HOME/bin/oratclsh` 移除 setuid 位，或直接删除 oratclsh 文件。升级到 Oracle 8.0.6 或 8.1.6 及以上版本可彻底修复此问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92609807906778&w=2","http://marc.info/?t=92550157100002&w=2&r=1","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19125","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64d76d92cfbd9c4de4a352a59a2e52cadebc3afd/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0711.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0711","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0711.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/89b3a1c34ab26afed5cfe4fc54b61cecbf09d3c2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0711.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1dbd44058e428445290bfb1f6fc6ecc0addbfd35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4pfh-v638-25xp/GHSA-4pfh-v638-25xp.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0711.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d1c0adaa-8a04-48dc-8913-b4362b415c10.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0303.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0711","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0711.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0711","title":"Oracle 8.x Intelligent Agent Unix版 oratclsh 解释器本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Oracle 8.x Intelligent Agent for Unix 中包含的 oratclsh 解释器未正确限制 Tcl 命令执行权限，本地用户可利用该解释器以 root 权限执行任意 Tcl 命令，实现本地权限提升。攻击者需要拥有系统本地访问权限，利用此漏洞可完全控制受影响的 Oracle 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0711"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-04-29T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-08-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"应用 Oracle 官方针对 8.x Intelligent Agent 的安全补丁。如无法立即修补，建议限制对 oratclsh 二进制文件的执行权限，仅允许受信任的管理员用户访问，并监控系统异常进程执行行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:04:47Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92609807906778&w=2","http://marc.info/?t=92550157100002&w=2&r=1"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0711.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0305","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0305.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0712","title":"Caldera Open Administration System 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Caldera Open Administration System (COAS) 存在权限配置不当漏洞，导致系统 /etc/shadow 密码文件被设置为全局可读。攻击者可通过本地访问读取该文件，获取系统所有用户的密码哈希值，进而通过离线破解获得明文密码。该漏洞影响 Caldera 相关操作系统版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，利用前提为攻击者已获得本地访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0712"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-04-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:53Z","remediation":"立即升级到受支持的现代 Linux 发行版（如 SUSE Linux Enterprise 或 OpenSUSE），Caldera OpenLinux 及 COAS 已停止维护多年，不再提供安全更新。如无法升级，可手动执行 `chmod 600 /etc/shadow` 确保 shadow 文件仅 root 可读，并移除 COAS 的 setuid 二进制文件或卸载 COAS 软件包以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0712","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6df16fc0c02ccadd2d0fbb0029e3db345d75f1c8/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0712.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0712","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0712.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ec31d5593e31331ed2058e001803e087d65aa416/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0712.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7h3x-fvwr-j2mc/GHSA-7h3x-fvwr-j2mc.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0712.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/137/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000617.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5fa43793-28e7-4c55-8c2b-61efcb2270d5.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/mega-foss/blob/4829eeb7b0101570abbc87d2a697f2c0c2f4e5c3/src/cve/graphql/trial.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0305.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0222","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0492","title":"GNU Ffingerd 用户名有效性信息泄露漏洞","description":"GNU Ffingerd 1.19 存在用户信息泄露漏洞。该软件作为 finger 协议的服务端实现，在处理用户查询请求时未对返回结果进行统一处理，导致远程攻击者可通过发送 finger 查询请求并根据服务端返回的差异响应来枚举系统有效用户名。攻击者无需任何认证即可利用此漏洞收集目标系统用户信息，为后续暴力破解或社会工程学攻击提供基础。该漏洞影响 GNU Ffingerd 1.19 及更早版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0492"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-23T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-04-23T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 GNU Ffingerd 至 1.20 及以上版本，该版本修复了用户名有效性泄露问题。如无法升级，可禁用 finger 服务（systemctl disable fingerd）或使用 iptables 限制对 79/TCP 端口的访问，仅允许可信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20327"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0209","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0490","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.0 MSHTML.DLL 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.0 的 MSHTML.DLL 组件存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 IMG SRC 标签的 HTML 页面，诱导用户使用 IE 浏览器访问该页面，从而探测目标用户本地文件系统中的文件是否存在及路径信息。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上安装的 Internet Explorer 5.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0490"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:30Z","remediation":"升级到 Internet Explorer 更高版本（如 IE 6.0 SP1 以上），或改用现代浏览器（如 Edge/Chrome/Firefox）。在 IE 中禁用活动脚本并将 Internet 区域安全级别设为「高」可缓解该信息泄露风险。由于 IE 5.0 已停止支持，建议彻底弃用该版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-012"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0206","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0488","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 跨帧脚本执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.0 及 5.0 存在跨框架脚本安全漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意 URL 诱使用户访问，在不同于源安全上下文中执行任意脚本代码。该漏洞属于跨框架变种，利用浏览器同源策略缺陷，可导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或权限提升。影响 Windows 平台上的 IE 4.0/5.0 用户，攻击者需诱导用户点击恶意链接，无需额外认证。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0488"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:30Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Internet Explorer 4.0/5.0，微软已不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级到现代浏览器（如 Microsoft Edge、Chrome、Firefox），并在组策略中禁用 Internet Explorer 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-012"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0127","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0127.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0466","title":"NetBSD SVR4 /dev/wabi 设备文件本地任意文件读写漏洞","description":"NetBSD 1.3.3 及之前版本的 SVR4 兼容层中 /dev/wabi 设备文件主设备编号配置错误，i386 平台错误使用主编号 3（实际应为 2），导致设备文件指向错误的磁盘设备。本地攻击者可利用此缺陷读取或写入磁盘关联的任意文件，造成敏感信息泄露及系统权限提升。利用该漏洞需具备本地系统访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0466"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-04-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 NetBSD 1.4 及以上版本（NetBSD-current 19990420 之后已修复），或应用官方补丁 19990419-SVR4_MAKEDEV 后重新运行 SVR4_MAKEDEV 脚本重建 /dev/wabi 设备。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 rm -f /emul/svr4/dev/wabi && mknod /emul/svr4/dev/wabi c 2 2 && chmod 666 /emul/svr4/dev/wabi，将设备主编号从 3 修正为 2。如不需要 SVR4 兼容，建议移除 /emul/svr4 模拟层。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0466"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0127.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0166","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0166.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0491","title":"GNU bash 路径嵌入代码执行漏洞","description":"Bash（GNU bash 1.14 及之前版本）的提示符解析功能存在代码注入漏洞。本地攻击者可在目标目录中创建与待执行命令同名的目录，当其他用户（如 root）进入该目录并执行 bash 时，提示符解析机制会错误地将目录名作为命令执行，导致攻击者以目标用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 GNU bash 1.14 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。利用条件为攻击者需拥有本地账号且能创建目录，并诱导目标用户进入恶意目录。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0491"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:30Z","remediation":"升级 bash 至 2.0 或更高版本，该漏洞在 bash 2.0 中已修复。如无法升级，避免在多用户环境中使用包含命令替换的 PS1 提示符，并限制非信任用户的本地访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/119","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.10.9904202114070.6623-100000%40smooth.Operator.org","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19095"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0166.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0178","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0178.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0607","title":"QuikStore 购物车 quikstore.cgi 配置信息泄露漏洞","description":"QuikStore 购物车系统的 quikstore.cgi 脚本将配置文件 quikstore.cfg 存储在 Web 根目录下，且未设置充分的访问控制。远程攻击者可直接访问该配置文件，获取明文存储的管理员密码，进而获得系统管理权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0607"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-04-20T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 quikstore.cfg 配置文件移出 Web 可访问目录，设置严格的访问权限，仅允许本地管理员读取。建议升级到已修复此问题的版本或更换为更安全的购物车系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T08:38:09Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92462991805485&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0178.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0178.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0178.toml"}]